  "awb---how-to-description": "Follow these 7 steps to make a club sign up sheet that sends every student to the right club roster.",
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Club Sign-Up Sheet FAQ\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a club sign up sheet?\", \"a\": \"A club sign up sheet is a list where people put their names down to join a club. It also asks for whatever the organizer needs to reach them, such as an email or a grade. At a school club fair, students add their names to each club they want to try. An online version files each name onto the right club's roster as it arrives.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create a club sign up sheet?\", \"a\": \"Start with two lists: the clubs, and the questions every student answers. Describe both in a prompt to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a>, along with any club that caps its members, and Emergent builds the sheet and a roster for each advisor. A typed copy of your old paper sheet is enough to start the prompt, and you can change the result by prompting again.\"}, {\"q\": \"Should a drama club sign up sheet ask about rehearsal conflicts?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Ask which weekday afternoons the student cannot stay after school, plus any known dates away, such as a family trip in March. The director can then plan rehearsals around real conflicts before casting, not after it.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is a club sign up sheet template enough, or should I build my own?\", \"a\": \"A template is enough when one club needs a list of names on paper. Build your own once several clubs share a sheet or a club has a cap on members. The same choice comes up with a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/potluck-sign-up-sheet'>potluck sign up sheet</a>, where a printed grid suits a small dinner and falls short once each course has slots that close.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I use a book club sign up sheet to rotate hosts?\", \"a\": \"Add a month picker and let each reader claim one month to host. Remove a month from the choices once it is taken, and the year's schedule builds itself as people sign up. Emergent can build a reminder email to each host a week before their month into the same app.\"}, {\"q\": \"How many students should an art club sign up sheet allow?\", \"a\": \"Set the cap from the room, not a round number. Count the seats at the art room tables, or the easels if members paint standing up, and stop the sheet there. If a club shares one kiln or one printing press, plan around how many pieces it takes in a session.\"}, {\"q\": \"What fields belong on a book club sign up sheet template?\", \"a\": \"Ask for a name and an email, plus a phone number for last-minute venue changes. Add a line for book suggestions if the group votes on titles, and a note field for anyone who reads in audio or large print. If the club grows into a public author event with sessions and badges, a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/conference-registration'>conference registration form</a> fits that better.\"}, {\"q\": \"How should I set up volunteer shifts on a booster club sign up sheet?\", \"a\": \"Make each shift its own slot with a set number of parents, and show the open count beside it, such as 2 of 4. A week before game day, email the whole parent list with only the shifts still open. The app Emergent builds can send that email from the same sheet, with no cap on how many parents sign up.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a chess club sign up sheet ask about experience?\", \"a\": \"Ask how long the student has played and whether they have a rating, with none as a valid answer. The advisor can then pair new players with each other for the first few weeks instead of matching them against the club's strongest players.\"}, {\"q\": \"Should a club sign up sheet collect a parent's contact details?\", \"a\": \"For students, yes: ask for a parent or guardian email, and check whether your school's own policy asks for anything more. For adult clubs, the member's own email is enough. A program that runs for weeks with medical and pickup details needs a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/summer-camp-registration'>summer camp registration form</a> instead.\"}]}; </script></div></div>",
